edures Program Accreditations Quality Enhancement Plan SACSCOC Accreditation Reports SACSCOC Principles SACSCOC Correspondence Strategic Plan Strategic Plan Progress Reports Strategic Planning Policy Student Achievement Data Substantive Change Policy Surveys University Data and Reports WEAVE Approved Academic Program CIP Codes Self-Studies and Compliance Certification Office of the Bursar Arrow How to Make a Payment Online Nelnet Refunds 1098-T Collections of Accounts Receivable Student Health Insurance Withdrawals Important Dates Office of Computing & Information Services Arrow Meet the Staff Marketing, Communications & Workforce Development Arrow Alumni Career and Professional Development Government Relations Marketing and Communications Event Management Purchasing Arrow E-Verify Vendor Info Resources A-Z Index News The Beep Blog Calendar Campus Map Faculty and Staff Directory Arrow Back Resources For Future Roadrunners Adult Learners Veterans Dual Enrollment Current Roadrunners Parents and Guardians Alumni Faculty and Staff Community and Business Online Education Mountain Campus Event Management La Comunidad Hispanohablante Roadrunner Scholars Program Resources A-Z Index Roadrunner Portal Email Academic Calendar Georgia VIEW Faculty CV and Syllabi News Event Calendar Community Events Campus Map The Beep Blog Disability Access Policies and Procedures Title IX Search results for Search Home Home Home Arrow Campus Life Arrow Dean of Students Office Arrow Dean of Students Office Welcome, Roadrunners! We are glad you are here…where Life Happens! Whether you are new to the campus community or a returning student, the Dean of Students Office (DoS) is dedicated to assisting you with your college journey at Dalton State. Hopefully, the links on this page will help you navigate areas that fall under the Dean of Students Office and serve as resources for you during your time at Dalton State. We strongly encourage you to take an active role in Campus Life! Learning both inside and outside of the classroom are highly valued, as this helps foster your holistic development. In addition, we are here as your support system. We are here to assist you with concerns, challenges or problems that you may need help resolving. We are located in the upper level of the Pope Student Center, directly across from the Campus Bookstore. In addition, our contact information is here . Overall, the Dean of Students Office seeks to support and advance the mission of Dalton State College by promoting student engagement, learning and development through intentional programming, support services and resources. Your journey starts here! Student Engagement and Belonging Peer Education Health and Wellness Testing Center Disability Access Community Standards & Student Outreach CARE Team The Nest Speak Up, We Listen Whether it’s a safety issue, academic concern, or anything in between, your input matters. Report anonymously or engage in a conversation – your actions help create a secure and thriving environment at Dalton State. CARE Team Student Conduct Helpful Resources CARE Team Learn More Right Arrow Community Standards & Outreach Learn More Right Arrow Disability Access Learn More Right Arrow Forms and Resources Learn More Right Arrow Hardship Withdrawal Policy Learn More Right Arrow Meet the Team Learn More Right Arrow Student Emergency Fund Learn More Right Arrow The Nest Learn More Right Arrow Map Marker 650 College Drive Dalton, GA 30720 Phone Icon (706) 272-4436 More Information A - Z Index Campus Map Accreditation Consumer Information Title IX Employment Request Info Schedule Tour ©  2026  Dalton State College Human Trafficking Notice Ethics Hotline XML Sitemap Privacy Policy Close"
